select $q$dhruv-star$q$,$q$Dhruv Star$q$,$q$YG-DHR-GD-BR$q$,$q$A single star outlasts every empire.$q$,$q$अमर तारा$q$,$q$["Limited"]$q$::jsonb,$q$Gold$q$,$q$Brown$q$,2999,5999,50,$q$in_stock$q$,85,$q$The pole star as it would look if it could be held. Gold case, brown strap, an embossed navy compass dial. Japanese quartz.$q$,$q$The pole star as it would look if it could be held. Warm gold surrounds a deep navy dial, and a brown strap grounds it, the earth beneath the sky. A warm gold tonneau case, a soft champagne in colour, never loud. The brown silicone strap is soft, light and moulded to sit flush against the case. Within is an accurate Japanese quartz movement. Dhruv Star belongs to Dhruv, one realm of the Yugastra sky: a timeless piece, made to be kept and not replaced.$q$,$q$एक तारा, प्रत्येक साम्राज्य से दीर्घायु।$q$,$q$ध्रुव तारा, मानो उसे हाथ में थामा जा सके। स्वर्ण आवरण, भूरा पट्टा, उभरे हुए नील डायल पर दिशासूचक। जापानी क्वार्ट्ज़।$q$,$q$ध्रुव तारा, मानो उसे हाथ में थामा जा सके। स्वर्ण टोन्यू आवरण, गहरी और समरूप सज्जा के साथ। भूरा सिलिकॉन पट्टा कोमल और हल्का है, और आवरण से सटकर बैठने के लिए ढला है। भीतर एक सटीक जापानी क्वार्ट्ज़ गति-तंत्र है। Dhruv Star युगास्त्र के आकाश के एक लोक की कृति है: कालातीत, सहेजने के लिए रची गई, बदले जाने के लिए नहीं।$q$,$q$["Embossed navy dial with raised gold detail", "Japanese quartz movement", "Gold tonneau case, Brown silicone strap", "1-year warranty", "Water resistant to 5 ATM (50 m)"]$q$::jsonb,$q$Dhruv Star · Dhruv Collection | YUGASTRA$q$,$q$A fixed star, worn in gold. Dhruv Star: gold case, brown strap, an embossed navy compass dial. Japanese quartz, 1-year warranty. From YUGASTRA, the weapon of timelessness. ₹5,999.$q$,$q$["https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BR-1.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BR-2.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BR-3.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BR-4.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BR-5.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BR-6.png"]$q$::jsonb,null,false,true,3,0,0,c.id,'{}'::jsonb from collections c where c.slug='dhruv'
