select $q$surya-eclipse$q$,$q$Surya Eclipse$q$,$q$YG-SUR-BK-BK$q$,$q$Even the sun is richer for its shadow.$q$,$q$तेज, छाया में$q$,$q$[]$q$::jsonb,$q$Black$q$,$q$Black$q$,2999,5999,50,$q$in_stock$q$,85,$q$Black on black, with only the gold remaining. Black case, black strap, an embossed gold sun on a black dial. Japanese quartz.$q$,$q$Black on black, with only the gold remaining. It is the moment of totality, when the sun is hidden and every one of its twelve rays is still there. A black tonneau case, with a deep and even finish. The black silicone strap is soft, light and moulded to sit flush against the case. Within is an accurate Japanese quartz movement. Surya Eclipse belongs to Surya, one realm of the Yugastra sky: a timeless piece, made to be kept and not replaced.$q$,$q$छाया से ही सूर्य की गरिमा गहराती है।$q$,$q$श्याम पर श्याम, केवल स्वर्ण शेष। श्याम आवरण, श्याम पट्टा, श्याम डायल पर उभरा स्वर्णिम सूर्य। जापानी क्वार्ट्ज़।$q$,$q$श्याम पर श्याम, केवल स्वर्ण शेष। श्याम टोन्यू आवरण, गहरी और समरूप सज्जा के साथ। श्याम सिलिकॉन पट्टा कोमल और हल्का है, और आवरण से सटकर बैठने के लिए ढला है। भीतर एक सटीक जापानी क्वार्ट्ज़ गति-तंत्र है। Surya Eclipse युगास्त्र के आकाश के एक लोक की कृति है: कालातीत, सहेजने के लिए रची गई, बदले जाने के लिए नहीं।$q$,$q$["Embossed black dial with twelve raised gold rays", "Japanese quartz movement", "Black tonneau case, Black silicone strap", "1-year warranty", "Water resistant to 5 ATM (50 m)"]$q$::jsonb,$q$Surya Eclipse · Surya Collection | YUGASTRA$q$,$q$The sun, held in shadow. Surya Eclipse: black case, black strap, an embossed gold sun on a black dial. Japanese quartz, 1-year warranty. From YUGASTRA, the weapon of timelessness. ₹5,999.$q$,$q$["https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SUR-BK-BK-1.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SUR-BK-BK-2.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SUR-BK-BK-3.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SUR-BK-BK-4.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SUR-BK-BK-5.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SUR-BK-BK-6.png"]$q$::jsonb,null,true,true,4,0,0,c.id,'{}'::jsonb from collections c where c.slug='surya'
