select $q$dhruv-crown$q$,$q$Dhruv Crown$q$,$q$YG-DHR-GD-BK-RD$q$,$q$The star that crowns the sky.$q$,null,$q$[]$q$::jsonb,$q$Gold$q$,$q$Black$q$,2999,5999,50,$q$in_stock$q$,60,$q$A round gold-coloured case, a black leather strap and a navy dial with a raised gold compass rose. DHRUV Crown, the Realm of Stillness.$q$,$q$Every night the sky turns around one point, and the pole star sits at its crown. Crown is that point, worn plainly: a round case in a soft champagne gold-coloured finish, set against deep navy. The compass rose and the Big Dipper are raised in gold, and the black leather strap keeps the night close around them. Where the other DHRUV watches speak of direction and the dark, this one stands for the fixed star itself.$q$,null,null,null,$q$["Embossed navy dial with raised gold detail", "Japanese quartz movement", "Round 40 mm case, gold finish", "22 mm black leather strap, stitched edges", "1-year warranty"]$q$::jsonb,$q$Dhruv Crown · Dhruv Collection | YUGASTRA$q$,$q$Dhruv Crown in a round 40 mm case: gold case, black leather strap. Japanese quartz, 1-year warranty. From YUGASTRA, the weapon of timelessness. ₹2,999.$q$,$q$["https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BK-RD-3.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BK-RD-4.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-DHR-GD-BK-RD-7.png"]$q$::jsonb,null,false,true,302,0,0,c.id,$q${"Collection": "DHRUV", "Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Gold, round, 40 mm", "Strap": "Black leather, 22 mm", "Dial": "Embossed navy dial", "Weight": "Approx. 60 g", "Warranty": "1 year", "Strap width": "22 mm"}$q$::jsonb from collections c where c.slug='dhruv'
