select $q$naksh-royal-ii$q$,$q$Naksh Royal II$q$,$q$YG-NAK-GD-BK-RD$q$,$q$True sovereignty is silent.$q$,$q$मौन प्रभुता$q$,$q$[]$q$::jsonb,$q$Gold$q$,$q$Black$q$,2999,5999,50,$q$in_stock$q$,60,$q$Gold case, black strap, a ring of twenty-seven stars. Gold case, black strap, an embossed maroon dial with twenty-seven stars. Japanese quartz.$q$,$q$Gold case, black strap, a ring of twenty-seven stars. It is regal without raising its voice, which is the only kind of regal worth owning. A warm gold round case, a soft champagne in colour, never loud. The black leather strap is stitched along both edges, with a fine grain and a soft sheen. Within is an accurate Japanese quartz movement. Naksh Royal II belongs to Naksh, one realm of the Yugastra sky: a timeless piece, made to be kept and not replaced.$q$,$q$सच्ची प्रभुता मौन होती है।$q$,null,null,$q$["Embossed maroon dial with 27 raised stars", "Japanese quartz movement", "Round 40 mm case, gold finish", "22 mm black leather strap, stitched edges", "1-year warranty"]$q$::jsonb,$q$Naksh Royal II · Naksh Collection | YUGASTRA$q$,$q$Naksh Royal II in a round 40 mm case: gold case, black leather strap. Japanese quartz, 1-year warranty. From YUGASTRA, the weapon of timelessness. ₹2,999.$q$,$q$["https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-NAK-GD-BK-RD-3.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-NAK-GD-BK-RD-4.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-NAK-GD-BK-RD-7.png"]$q$::jsonb,null,false,true,307,0,0,c.id,$q${"Collection": "NAKSH", "Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Gold, round, 40 mm", "Strap": "Black leather, 22 mm", "Dial": "Embossed maroon dial", "Weight": "Approx. 60 g", "Warranty": "1 year", "Strap width": "22 mm"}$q$::jsonb from collections c where c.slug='naksh'
