select $q$soma-crescent-ii$q$,$q$Soma Crescent II$q$,$q$YG-SOM-SL-BK-RD$q$,$q$Thirty nights teach patience. The moon never rushes.$q$,$q$धैर्य की कला$q$,$q$[]$q$::jsonb,$q$Silver$q$,$q$Black$q$,2999,5999,50,$q$in_stock$q$,60,$q$Silver case, black strap, graphite dial. Silver case, black strap, an embossed graphite dial with a silver crescent. Japanese quartz.$q$,$q$Silver case, black strap, graphite dial. The moon in its simplest form, with fifteen bright dots and fifteen dark for its waxing and waning. A polished silver round case, bright as moonlight on water. The black leather strap is stitched along both edges, with a fine grain and a soft sheen. Within is an accurate Japanese quartz movement. Soma Crescent II belongs to Soma, one realm of the Yugastra sky: a timeless piece, made to be kept and not replaced.$q$,$q$तीस रात्रियाँ धैर्य सिखाती हैं; चंद्र कभी शीघ्रता नहीं करता।$q$,null,null,$q$["Embossed graphite dial with a silver crescent", "Japanese quartz movement", "Round 40 mm case, silver finish", "22 mm black leather strap, stitched edges", "1-year warranty"]$q$::jsonb,$q$Soma Crescent II · Soma Collection | YUGASTRA$q$,$q$Soma Crescent II in a round 40 mm case: silver case, black leather strap. Japanese quartz, 1-year warranty. From YUGASTRA, the weapon of timelessness. ₹2,999.$q$,$q$["https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SOM-SL-BK-RD-3.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SOM-SL-BK-RD-4.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SOM-SL-BK-RD-7.png"]$q$::jsonb,null,false,true,310,0,0,c.id,$q${"Collection": "SOMA", "Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Silver, round, 40 mm", "Strap": "Black leather, 22 mm", "Dial": "Embossed graphite dial", "Weight": "Approx. 60 g", "Warranty": "1 year", "Strap width": "22 mm"}$q$::jsonb from collections c where c.slug='soma'
