select $q$soma-new-moon-ii$q$,$q$Soma New Moon II$q$,$q$YG-SOM-BK-BK-RD$q$,$q$In the dark, everything is still possible.$q$,$q$संभावना की रात्रि$q$,$q$[]$q$::jsonb,$q$Matte black$q$,$q$Black$q$,2999,5999,50,$q$in_stock$q$,60,$q$All black, with the crescent barely there. Black case, black strap, an embossed graphite dial with a silver crescent. Japanese quartz.$q$,$q$All black, with the crescent barely there. It is the new moon, when nothing is shown and everything is promised. A black round case, with a deep and even finish. The black leather strap is stitched along both edges, with a fine grain and a soft sheen. Within is an accurate Japanese quartz movement. Soma New Moon II belongs to Soma, one realm of the Yugastra sky: a timeless piece, made to be kept and not replaced.$q$,$q$अंधकार में सब कुछ अब भी संभव है।$q$,null,null,$q$["Embossed graphite dial with a silver crescent", "Japanese quartz movement", "Round 40 mm case, matte black finish", "22 mm black leather strap, stitched edges", "1-year warranty"]$q$::jsonb,$q$Soma New Moon II · Soma Collection | YUGASTRA$q$,$q$Soma New Moon II in a round 40 mm case: matte black case, black leather strap. Japanese quartz, 1-year warranty. From YUGASTRA, the weapon of timelessness. ₹2,999.$q$,$q$["https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SOM-BK-BK-RD-3.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SOM-BK-BK-RD-4.png", "https://5n9sx3cugrn0sd1z.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/yugastra/products/YG-SOM-BK-BK-RD-7.png"]$q$::jsonb,null,false,true,311,0,0,c.id,$q${"Collection": "SOMA", "Movement": "Japanese quartz", "Case": "Matte black, round, 40 mm", "Strap": "Black leather, 22 mm", "Dial": "Embossed graphite dial", "Weight": "Approx. 60 g", "Warranty": "1 year", "Strap width": "22 mm"}$q$::jsonb from collections c where c.slug='soma'
